# scaleup_single_switch_4_12800Gbps.topo
# 4-host NVLink-class scale-up domain: one non-blocking crossbar (Podsize==Nodes==
# Radix_Down => 1 ToR, every pair one hop). Per-host 12800 Gbps = the MAX of the
# intranode-linkspeed sweep, so the swept -intranode_linkspeed (NIC/copy-engine
# rate) governs under the fabric ceiling at every point (flag <= topo => min = flag;
# see AA-plan-Intranode-Linkspeed-Sweep §7). Degenerate 2-tier encoding because the
# FatTree parser rejects Tiers=1. Sibling of the validated scaleup_single_switch_4.
Nodes 4
Tiers 2
Podsize 4

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 12800
Radix_Down 4
Radix_Up 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 300
Oversubscribed 4

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 12800
Radix_Down 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 300
